   <chapter title="Overview">
       <p><b>File:</b> <code>OtherTests/IndividualClientFunctionality/Add_Edit_Client_FATCA_test.cy.ts</code></p>
        <p><b>Folder:</b> <code>OtherTests/IndividualClientFunctionality</code></p>
        <p><b>Description:</b> End-to-end validation of configuring FATCA prerequisites in Settings and assigning FATCA data to an individual client</p>
